summary:
- topic: Meeting Opening and Roll Call
  text: The SouthPortlandBoardof Education convened a special meeting, establishing
    a quorum with six members present and three absent.
- topic: Staff Resignations
  text: The board announced the resignations of Assistant Director of Instructional
    Support BrianCavanaugh, kindergarten teacher AmyBrier, and grade one teacher AngelaCorcoran,
    wishing them well in their future roles.
- topic: Personnel Elections
  text: The board approved several personnel elections for the upcoming school year,
    including AnnaBolton, MeghanHenderson, CollinMagarian, and ShelbySantor.
- topic: Administrative Appointments
  text: SarahGlenn was appointed as the new principal of SPHS, and HermenegildoPaulo
    was appointed as the Director of Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion for the district.
- topic: Audience of Citizens
  text: The board opened the floor for public comments on agenda items, but no citizens
    stepped forward to speak.
- topic: Executive Session
  text: The board voted unanimously to enter into ExecutiveSession pursuant to 1MRSA§405(6)(D)
    to discuss collective bargaining with the SouthPortlandSchool DepartmentserviceEmployeesAssociation.
- topic: Adjournment
  text: Following the executive session, the board returned to the SPHSLectureHall
    and voted to adjourn the meeting.
